OL,3,GNEWSAAround 6000 still without power in
OL,4,ANI and Republic after Storm Boelo
OL,5,
OL,6,FAround 6,000 customers across the
OL,7,Fisland of Ireland are still without
OL,8,Fpower after Storm Boelo.
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland Electricity Networks
OL,11,F(NIE) said less than 1,000 customers
OL,12,Fremain affected, while about 5,000
OL,13,Fhomes, farms and businesses across the
OL,14,FRepublic of Ireland are still without
OL,15,Felectricity on Sunday evening.
OL,17,FThe storm saw gusts of wind reach
OL,18,Falmost 80mph in some areas on Saturday
OL,19,Fand led to flights being cancelled at
OL,20,FBelfast City, Belfast International and
OL,21,FDublin Airport.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
